Searchlight 98 0.3.3 - Quick launcher for
Windows 95/98. Press Ctrl+Space, type a
few letters, press Enter. Finds programs,
settings and documents. Favorites by drag
and drop, running programs with memory
gauges, startup manager, calculator, Run.
Learns what you use. One small EXE, no
DLLs. Free and open source (MIT license).
